				<wikidot:authorName>Monteparnas</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2926286</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I've been without SPC articles and references for so much time that it actually managed to take me by surprise completely. And that because I was thinking about how people seemed to forget the SPC just yesterday!</p> <p>Amazingly well done. It managed to keep the mood and tone of the critter profile all the way until the *punch*line. It isn't an easy feat, and the &quot;informal but informed&quot; tone of WWS doesn't actually makes it intuitive, it is too easy to slip in the silliness too soon.</p> <p>Upvoted with enthusiasm, and someone must make Wilson's Selachian Wrestling a thing!</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
